@ref 8 Del. C. § 122(17) (src:265)
GIVEN `where the interest or expectancy is renounced` IS A `Where a provision is made`
      `the opportunities are specified business opportunities or specified classes or categories of business opportunities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the opportunities are presented to the corporation or 1 or more of its officers, directors or stockholders` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 122(17) the corporation may renounce the interest or expectancy` `where the interest or expectancy is renounced` `the opportunities are specified business opportunities or specified classes or categories of business opportunities` `the opportunities are presented to the corporation or 1 or more of its officers, directors or stockholders` MEANS
    IF   (   `where the interest or expectancy is renounced` EQUALS `in the certificate of incorporation`
          OR `where the interest or expectancy is renounced` EQUALS `in a resolution of the board of directors`)
         AND `the opportunities are specified business opportunities or specified classes or categories of business opportunities`
         AND `the opportunities are presented to the corporation or 1 or more of its officers, directors or stockholders`
    THEN JUST TRUE
