§ `Section 122(18): contracts with stockholders`

DECLARE `s 122(18) Facts about the contract` HAS
    `the contract is made with 1 or more current or prospective stockholders, or 1 or more beneficial owners of stock, in its or their capacity as such` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the consideration is at least the minimum consideration determined by the board of directors` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the provision is contrary to the certificate of incorporation` IS A BOOLEAN
-- out of range: the laws of this State other than section 115 (piece dg1 for section 115; the rest of the Code is not among the inputs): whether the provision would be contrary to them is a plain input.
    `the provision would be contrary to the laws of this State (other than section 115) if included in the certificate of incorporation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the provision is a restriction, prohibition or covenant that relates to a specified action` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the only reason the provision is contrary is a provision of this title or of the certificate of incorporation that authorizes or empowers the board of directors (or any 1 or more directors) to take that action` IS A BOOLEAN

-- (18): "Notwithstanding § 141(a) of this title, make contracts with 1 or more current or prospective stockholders (or 1 or more beneficial
-- owners of stock), in its or their capacity as such, in exchange for such minimum consideration as determined by the board of directors".
