GIVEN f IS A `s 122(18) Facts about the contract`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 122(18) the contract is one the corporation may make with stockholders` f MEANS
        f's `the contract is made with 1 or more current or prospective stockholders, or 1 or more beneficial owners of stock, in its or their capacity as such`
    AND f's `the consideration is at least the minimum consideration determined by the board of directors`

-- (18), proviso: "provided that no provision of such contract shall be enforceable against the corporation to the extent such contract
-- provision is contrary to the certificate of incorporation or would be contrary to the laws of this State (other than § 115 of this title)
-- if included in the certificate of incorporation." And: "Solely for purposes of applying the proviso in the first sentence of this
-- subsection, a restriction, prohibition or covenant in any such contract that relates to any specified action shall not be deemed contrary
-- to the laws of this State or the certificate of incorporation by reason of a provision of this title or the certificate of incorporation
-- that authorizes or empowers the board of directors (or any 1 or more directors) to take such action." A provision of a contract that is
-- not a contract under this paragraph: not covered.
-- src:266 | provided that no provision of such contract shall be enforceable against the corporation to the extent such contract provision is contrary to the certificate of incorporation or would be contrary to the laws of this State (other than § 115 of this title) if included in the certificate of incorporation. …
-- src:266 | Solely for purposes of applying the proviso in the first sentence of this subsection, a restriction, prohibition or covenant in any such contract that relates to any specified action shall not be deemed contrary to the laws of this State or the certificate of incorporation by reason of a provision of this title or the certificate of incorporation that authorizes or empowers the board of directors (or any 1 or more directors) to take such action. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 122(18) (src:266)
GIVEN f IS A `s 122(18) Facts about the contract`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 122(18) the contract provision is enforceable against the corporation` f MEANS
    IF   NOT (`s 122(18) the contract is one the corporation may make with stockholders` f)
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE JUST (NOT (contraryToTheCertificate OR contraryToTheLaws))
    WHERE
        deemedNotContrary MEANS
                f's `the provision is a restriction, prohibition or covenant that relates to a specified action`
            AND f's `the only reason the provision is contrary is a provision of this title or of the certificate of incorporation that authorizes or empowers the board of directors (or any 1 or more directors) to take that action`
        contraryToTheCertificate MEANS f's `the provision is contrary to the certificate of incorporation` AND (NOT deemedNotContrary)
        contraryToTheLaws MEANS f's `the provision would be contrary to the laws of this State (other than section 115) if included in the certificate of incorporation` AND (NOT deemedNotContrary)

DECLARE `s 122(18) Kind of undertaking` IS ONE OF
    `to restrict or prohibit itself from taking actions specified in the contract`
    `to require the approval or consent of 1 or more persons or bodies before it may take actions specified in the contract`
    `to covenant that it or 1 or more persons or bodies will take, or refrain from taking, actions specified in the contract`
    `an undertaking of any other kind`

-- "Without limiting the provisions that may be included in any such contracts, the corporation may agree to: (a) restrict or prohibit
-- itself from taking actions specified in the contract, (b) require the approval or consent of 1 or more persons or bodies before the
-- corporation may take actions specified in the contract (which persons or bodies may include the board of directors or 1 or more current
-- or future directors, stockholders or beneficial owners of stock of the corporation), and (c) covenant that the corporation or 1 or
-- more persons or bodies will take, or refrain from taking, actions specified in the contract". The list does not limit: another kind is not covered.
