§ `Section 123: powers respecting securities of other corporations or entities`

DECLARE `s 123 Kind of dealing` IS ONE OF
    `to guarantee, purchase, take, receive, subscribe for or otherwise acquire`
    `to own, hold, use or otherwise employ`
    `to sell, lease, exchange, transfer or otherwise dispose of`
    `to mortgage, lend, pledge or otherwise deal in and with`

DECLARE `s 123 Kind of issuer` IS ONE OF
    `another domestic or foreign corporation, under s 123`
    `a partnership, under s 123`
    `an association, under s 123`
    `an individual, under s 123`
    `a government or an agency or instrumentality of a government, under s 123`
    `an issuer of some other kind, under s 123`

-- "Any corporation organized under the laws of this State may guarantee, purchase, take, receive, subscribe for or otherwise acquire; own,
-- hold, use or otherwise employ; sell, lease, exchange, transfer or otherwise dispose of; mortgage, lend, pledge or otherwise deal in and
-- with, bonds and other obligations of, or shares or other securities or interests in, or issued by, any other domestic or foreign
-- corporation, partnership, association or individual, or by any government or agency or instrumentality thereof." An issuer of some
-- other kind (a limited liability company or a trust, say, if it is not an "association") is not named: the text does not say.
-- src:270 | Any corporation organized under the laws of this State may guarantee, purchase, take, receive, subscribe for or otherwise acquire; own, hold, use or otherwise employ; sell, lease, exchange, transfer or otherwise dispose of; mortgage, lend, pledge or otherwise deal in and with, bonds and other obligations of, or shares or other securities or interests in, or issued by, any other domestic or foreign corporation, partnership, association or individual, or by any government or agency or instrumentality thereof. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 123 (src:270)
GIVEN `the corporation is organized under the laws of this State` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the dealing` IS A `s 123 Kind of dealing`
      `the issuer` IS A `s 123 Kind of issuer`
      `the securities are bonds or other obligations of, or shares or other securities or interests in, or issued by, the issuer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 123 the corporation may deal in the securities` `the corporation is organized under the laws of this State` `the dealing` `the issuer` `the securities are bonds or other obligations of, or shares or other securities or interests in, or issued by, the issuer` MEANS
    IF   (NOT `the corporation is organized under the laws of this State`) OR (NOT `the securities are bonds or other obligations of, or shares or other securities or interests in, or issued by, the issuer`)
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE CONSIDER `the issuer`
         WHEN `an issuer of some other kind, under s 123` THEN NOTHING
         OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

